      "status": "present",
      "detail": "Transactions WHERE Type='P' (all Deleted values, see deleted_raw), joined to Plans on PlanNum. status planned_applied = Applied=1: the item has been posted as completed and a Type=' ' row exists for it. Transactions is the clinical chart ledger (what the Treatment view shows); tdi is the financial ledger. Planned items entered through the modern Treatment view are mirrored into tdi (itype 'P', sentinel itrid 99999998); older fictional plans exist only in Transactions, so financial_mirror is null for them. bridge_group is Transactions.Grp: 0/null for single units; for bridge units it is the 1..n position within the bridge (retainer, pontic, ...). Consecutive rows with ascending Grp starting at 1 form one bridge; Grp is not a shared bridge id."
    }
  },
