    "source_assurance": {
      "status": "present",
      "detail": "Transactions WHERE Type=' ' AND Code<>'' AND Deleted=0. financial_mirror is the tdi row (itype='') with the same code and tooth, matched on posting date first and equal fee second (financial_mirror_match: code_tooth_date, code_tooth_fee_nearest within 400 days, or unmatched); each tdi row mirrors at most one clinical row. duplicate_of points a same-day chart companion row (Appt=0, Phase=0) at its appointment posting; count only rows with duplicate_of null. bridge_group is Transactions.Grp: 0/null for single units; for bridge units it is the 1..n position within the bridge (retainer, pontic, ...). Consecutive rows with ascending Grp starting at 1 form one bridge; Grp is not a shared bridge id."
    }
  },
